sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Platform authentication happens inside the webhook handler
accDescr: A public function URL permits invocation, but the handler verifies the third-party signature before processing, rejecting invalid requests.
participant P as Social platform
participant U as Function URL
participant L as Lambda handler
P->>U: HTTPS POST and platform signature
U->>U: NONE auth and resource policy
U->>L: Invoke handler
L->>L: Verify signature and replay rules
alt Valid request
L->>L: Process idempotently
L-->>P: Success response
else Invalid request
L-->>P: Reject request
end
